  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Reactor is Powah's multiblock generator. One complete reactor uses 36 Reactor blocks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Use the Reactor block item with enough same-tier blocks available and a clear 3×4×3 build volume; the structure is assembled as one machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Uraninite is the main reactor fuel. Furnace fuels provide carbon, redstone contributes heat, and liquid or solid coolants control temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Dry Ice is a particularly useful solid coolant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "In automatic generation mode the reactor stops producing when its internal buffer is full and starts again after it falls to 70% or lower."
    },
